roff="50">&#x0003e;30.00</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003e;10.00</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003e;15.00</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t2-fn1"><label>a</label><p>Data are expressed as IC<sub>50</sub> values (means of three experiments performed in triplicate) of the tested drugs (temozolomide, TMZ, carmustine, BCNU; doxorubicin, DOX; liposomal doxorubicin, L-DOX; daunomycin, DM; etoposide, VP-16; cisplatin, CDDP; bleomycin, BLEO).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>